            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Risky words

- Two new switches under Block risky words: **Block high risk words** (on by
  default) and **Block medium risk words** (off by default). Medium adds
  profanity and words that can also have an innocent meaning.
- Much larger built-in word lists in English, Bangla, romanised Bangla and
  Arabic, the same lists your organisation's console uses.
- On a managed Mac, the organisation's choice of lists applies. You can switch
  on an extra list, but not turn off one your organisation set.
]]></description>
